@startuml
!theme plain
title Student Planner - MVC Interaction Flow (Add Task)

actor User
participant PlannerView
participant PlannerController
participant PlannerService
participant PlannerModel
participant AbstractModel
participant ModelListener

User -> PlannerView: Clicks "Add Task"
PlannerView -> PlannerController: actionPerformed()
PlannerController -> PlannerController: validateInput()
PlannerController -> PlannerService: addTask()
PlannerService -> PlannerService: validateBusinessRules()
PlannerService -> PlannerModel: addTask()
PlannerModel -> PlannerModel: store task
PlannerModel -> AbstractModel: fireModelChanged("TASK_ADDED")
AbstractModel -> ModelListener: notifyListeners()
ModelListener -> PlannerView: modelChanged()
PlannerView -> PlannerView: refreshTaskList()
PlannerView --> User: Show updated list

note right of PlannerService
  Business logic validation:
  - Check course exists
  - Validate due date
  - Check for duplicates
end note

note right of AbstractModel
  Observer Pattern:
  - All registered listeners
  - receive notification
  - and update accordingly
end note

@enduml
